                "description": "NEW DCE only. Disabled requires separately configured AMPLS, private endpoints and DNS. Enabled requires approval for public HTTPS ingestion."
              },
              "allowedValues": [
                "Disabled",
                "Enabled"
              ],
              "defaultValue": "Disabled"
